{"seq":1,"slug":"new-seller-traffic-boost","title":"新店流量扶持期与曝光加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-growth-enablement/new-merchant-coldstart/new-seller-traffic-boost","wordCount":2730,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"新店流量扶持期与曝光加权\">新店流量扶持期与曝光加权</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个卖家在上线第三天打开后台，看到访客数是 0。他在商品详情页里反复检查，图片正常、价格正常、库存正常，他找不到任何理由解释为什么一个人都没有。真实原因不在他的页面上，而在排序系统里：决定谁能出现在搜索结果前排的那组特征——历史销量、评价数量与评分、点击率、履约时效——对一个没有任何成交记录的店铺全部是缺失值，而排序模型对缺失值的处理是惩罚性的，它无法区分「没有数据」和「数据很差」。扶持系统存在的唯一理由，是在新店产生第一批真实数据之前，人为地把它从缺失值惩罚里拉出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扶持不是送流量-是在打分函数里加一项\">扶持不是送流量，是在打分函数里加一项</h2><p>把排序看作一个打分函数会立刻看清扶持的实现位置。假设商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 下的基础相关性得分是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，平台对它的最终排序依据是若干业务目标的加权组合，通常写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Score</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}_i = \\sum_{j=1}^{m} w_j f_j(i, q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各个目标特征（相关性、转化率预估、履约质量、价格竞争力等），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。扶持的工程实现是在这个和之外加一个<strong>与商品自身历史无关、只与店铺状态和时间有关</strong>的加项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Score</mtext><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Score</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>eligible</mtext><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}_i&#x27; = \\text{Score}_i + B_s \\cdot \\lambda(t) \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{eligible}_s]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0721em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8251em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eligible</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是店铺 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的基础扶持强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是随开店时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 衰减的系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\cdot]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是资格指示函数。这样设计有三个必须坚持的性质。第一，加项与内容相关性无关，它不能让一个完全不相关的商品排到最前面，否则买家侧体验会立刻恶化——工程上通常把这个加项约束在排序位置的一个固定带宽内（例如强制提升不超过前 N 位），而不是加到分数上任由它爬到首位。第二，加项随店铺状态变化，店铺一旦产生足够的历史数据，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 衰减到接近零，排序自然交还给算法。第三，资格是布尔量而不是连续量，这让「谁有资格」成为一个可审计、可申诉、可撤销的判定，而不是模型内部不可解释的偏好。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扶持注入方式</th>\n<th>实现位置</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分数加项</td>\n<td>排序打分函数内</td>\n<td>简单，天然与权重体系共存</td>\n<td>可能压过相关性，需要封顶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置带宽提升</td>\n<td>重排阶段</td>\n<td>可控，买家体验有硬边界</td>\n<td>与个性化重排冲突，需串行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立扶持流量池</td>\n<td>召回阶段新增一路</td>\n<td>完全不影响自然排序，可独立计量</td>\n<td>流量池容量有限，曝光质量偏低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向坑位</td>\n<td>频道/活动页</td>\n<td>成本清晰、可售卖化</td>\n<td>覆盖面窄，不适合长尾商品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产系统里通常四种混用：主搜用位置带宽提升保证买家体验，推荐流用独立流量池保证扶持资源可计量，频道坑位用于定向品类。四条路径的共同点是都必须把「是不是扶持位」这个标记透传到曝光日志，否则后面的效果评估无从做起。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[新店开店] --&gt; B{资格判定}&#10;    B --&gt;|不满足| C[进入普通冷启动]&#10;    B --&gt;|满足| D[激活扶持加权]&#10;    D --&gt; E[曝光含扶持标记]&#10;    E --&gt; F[产生点击/加购/成交]&#10;    F --&gt; G[店铺历史特征积累]&#10;    G --&gt; H{历史充分?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[衰减系数下调]&#10;    I --&gt; E&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[退出扶持 交还自然排序]&#10;    C --&gt; K[完成资格清单]&#10;    K --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[新店开店] --&gt; B{资格判定}\n    B --&gt;|不满足| C[进入普通冷启动]\n    B --&gt;|满足| D[激活扶持加权]\n    D --&gt; E[曝光含扶持标记]\n    E --&gt; F[产生点击/加购/成交]\n    F --&gt; G[店铺历史特征积累]\n    G --&gt; H{历史充分?}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[衰减系数下调]\n    I --&gt; E\n    H --&gt;|是| J[退出扶持 交还自然排序]\n    C --&gt; K[完成资格清单]\n    K --&gt; B</pre><p>资格判定的具体条件不在本篇展开——它由 <a href=\"listing-quality-onboarding\">商品完善度引导与首发</a> 定义，本篇只假设存在这么一个可以实时判定的布尔量，并且它必须是<strong>可以被撤销</strong>的：一旦店铺出现严重违规或扶持流量被判定为异常，资格立刻置否，加权项在下一次排序请求中就消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扶持窗口与衰减曲线的设计\">扶持窗口与衰减曲线的设计</h2><p>扶持窗口的长度不是拍脑袋定的，它由「这段时间够不够跑出可用数据」倒推。一条粗略但被广泛使用的经验是：一个新商品需要至少几百次曝光才能得到点击率的稳定估计，而访客到成交的转化在多数类目下是 1% 到 3% 量级，所以跑出十单成交大约需要数千次曝光。如果扶持给的是每天几百次曝光，那么窗口至少要几周。窗口太短，数据还没收敛扶持就断了，新店回到零曝光状态；窗口太长，扶持预算被长期占用、排序被长期扭曲。</p>\n<p>衰减函数的选择决定扶持的「退出体感」。三种常见形态各有取舍：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（线性）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_1(t) = \\max\\left(0, 1 - \\frac{t}{T}\\right) \\quad\\text{（线性）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（线性）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（指数）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_2(t) = e^{-t/\\tau} \\quad\\text{（指数）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（指数）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（数据驱动）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_3(t) = \\min\\left(1, \\frac{c}{c + n(t)}\\right) \\quad\\text{（数据驱动）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（数据驱动）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>线性衰减的问题是断崖式的——最后一段扶持力度已经很小但仍在生效，卖家容易产生「我的流量被平台掐了」的错觉。指数衰减前半段下降极快，可能在新店还没跑出数据时就已经衰减到无效水平，只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 取得足够大时才可用。第三种是工程上更常走的路：让衰减系数由<strong>已积累的样本量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是常数（相当于「多少样本量时扶持减半」）。它的好处是扶持退出与数据成熟度直接对齐，一个卖得快的店铺更快退出扶持、更早进入自然竞争，一个卖得慢的店铺得到更长的扶持，总量上更公平，也更符合「扶持是为了消除信息缺失」这个原始动机。这也是数据驱动衰减对业务方的解释成本更高的原因：卖家看到的窗口长度因人而异，需要一个明确的规则说明页来解释。</p>\n<p>窗口的另一个维度是<strong>多长算多久</strong>的问题：是从开店时间算，还是从首次上架商品算，还是从首次产生成交算？从开店算的问题是大量卖家开完店放置几周才真正开始经营，扶持被浪费在休眠期。从首次上架算更合理，但仍可能撞上卖家上架后不推广的情况。工程上常见做法是取多个起算点中的最晚者，并加一个「活跃度门禁」——连续 N 天无登录或无商品操作则暂停计时，把扶持预算让给活跃的新店。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用反事实证明扶持有效\">用反事实证明扶持有效</h2><p>扶持系统最危险的失败模式不是无效，而是<strong>看起来有效</strong>。新店的成交数据本来就会随开店时间上升（卖家在学习、商品在优化、评价在积累），如果只用「扶持组店铺的成交在涨」来证明效果，任何时间段都会得到正结论。这是典型的因果推断陷阱，必须用反事实。</p>\n<p>最干净的做法是<strong>随机对照组</strong>：在满足资格的新店中随机抽一小部分（例如 5%）不发放扶持，作为 holdout。这个做法的成本极高，因为对照组店铺真的会因为没有流量而死掉一部分，业务方通常不愿意接受。折中的做法是<strong>时间窗对照</strong>或<strong>地理/类目轮换</strong>：把扶持资源在小块市场间轮换，未轮到的市场作为当期对照，用双重差分（Difference-in-Differences）估计效果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treated,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treated,pre</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control,pre</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau} = \\left(\\bar{Y}_{\\text{treated,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{treated,pre}}\\right) - \\left(\\bar{Y}_{\\text{control,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{control,pre}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treated,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treated,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>双重差分要求平行趋势假设成立——如果扶持组和对照组在扶持前的趋势本来就不一样（例如扶持组是平台主动挑选的高潜力商家），估计会有偏。因此资格判定必须尽量基于<strong>与结果无关的规则</strong>（开店时间、完善度），而不是基于预测的潜力分，否则反事实从一开始就不成立，后面所有效果指标都不可信。</p>\n<p>评估指标本身也需要分层，不能只看 GMV。扶持的真正目标是让店铺<strong>平滑地过渡到自然流量</strong>，所以核心指标应该是扶持结束后的自然流量水平与留存，而不是扶持期间的成交总额。工程上建议同时跟踪四个层级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标层级</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过程</td>\n<td>扶持曝光量、扶持位点击率</td>\n<td>资源有没有真的投出去</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短期结果</td>\n<td>扶持期成交、首单时长</td>\n<td>新店有没有跑起来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期结果</td>\n<td>扶持结束后 30 天的自然曝光与复购</td>\n<td>是否形成了可持续的造血</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态成本</td>\n<td>单位新增留存商家的扶持曝光成本</td>\n<td>这笔预算划不划算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个健康的扶持系统应当看到：扶持期成交显著高于对照，但<strong>长</strong>期内扶持组的自然曝光也高于对照——说明扶持确实帮助店铺积累了有效历史特征。如果长期看两组自然曝光趋于相同，说明扶持只是在补贴本来就会成功的店，或者在为低质量店铺续命，两种情况下都应该收紧资格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>扶持系统的设计可以收敛成几条必须坚持的原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扶持是排序打分函数里的一个<strong>可撤销、有衰减、封顶的加项</strong>，不是独立的流量通道，它的存在理由是消除新店历史特征的缺失值惩罚，而不是奖励商家。</li>\n<li>衰减系数最好由已积累的样本量驱动，让扶持退出与数据成熟度对齐，而不是由固定的时间表驱动。</li>\n<li>效果评估必须用反事实：随机 holdout、时间窗对照或市场轮换，并把关注点放在扶持结束后的自然流量与留存，而不是扶持期间的 GMV。</li>\n<li>资格是布尔量且必须实时可撤销，它的判定依赖商品完善度与首发审核，两者共同构成扶持资源发放的对价。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>扶持一旦被证明有效，紧接着的问题就是怎么保证发出去的东西没有被薅走——扶持资格、配额与反作弊机制见 <a href=\"coldstart-fairness\">扶持公平性与防薅羊毛</a>，它与本篇共享同一套资格布尔量与衰减系数，反作弊要保护的就是这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不被劣质店铺循环领取。同时，扶持结束后的店铺会进入常规的经营引导流程，任务与清单的编排见 <a href=\"../growth-task-guidance/merchant-task-system\">经营成长任务体系</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"新店流量扶持期与曝光加权","id":"新店流量扶持期与曝光加权"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"扶持不是送流量，是在打分函数里加一项","id":"扶持不是送流量-是在打分函数里加一项"},{"level":2,"text":"扶持窗口与衰减曲线的设计","id":"扶持窗口与衰减曲线的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"用反事实证明扶持有效","id":"用反事实证明扶持有效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"商品完善度引导与首发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-growth-enablement/new-merchant-coldstart/listing-quality-onboarding"}}